---
// PLAN-about.md §2: the bio copy verbatim from the plan (copyedits already
// applied there), the résumé download, and the date line.
const written = "August 11, 2026";
---

<div class="bio float-up" style="--delay: var(--delay-intro)">
	<h1>Hello, I'm <span><br>Xander Riddle</span></h1>

	<p>
		I'm a 5th year computer science student at Georgia Tech, and a
		self-proclaimed full-stack robotics engineer. If I were to describe myself
		by my interests, 3 come to mind: robotics, music and video games. I spend
		most of my free time building robots, and really enjoy leading the RoboWrestling 
		team at Georgia Tech. Music has also been a very big part of my life for a long 
		time. I have marched across the country in both the UGA and Georgia Tech marching 
		bands, and have participated in a number of ensembles. These days I just like to 
		jam with my friends back home. And a good game that I played recently was Silk Song.
	</p>

	<p>
		This past year I was promoted to Project Manager of the RoboWrestling team, where I was
		able to increase the quality of bots and the number of competitions we competed 
		at by taking my team to both Japan and Brazil, and winning 4th place in 2 categories 
		in Brazil. I also picked up 2 hardware teaching assistant jobs, and most recently I worked at a
		startup called Kovari, where I got acclimated to the fast-paced
		individual development environment, and it showed me that a startup might be
		more achievable than I previously thought.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm really looking forward to my 5th year of school, and excited for what
		the future has in store for me.
	</p>

	<div class="sign-off">
		<a
			class="resume"
			href="/resume.pdf"
			download="Xander-Riddle-Resume.pdf"
			type="application/pdf"
		>
			<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
				<path d="M12 3v12" />
				<path d="m7.5 10.5 4.5 4.5 4.5-4.5" />
				<path d="M4.5 18.5V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h13a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1.5" />
			</svg>
			Download Resume
		</a>

		<p class="written">Written {written}</p>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.bio {
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}

	h1 span {
		color: var(--blue);
	}

	.bio p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 1vw, 1.0625rem);
	}

	.bio p + p {
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}

	/* Button left, date right, on one line. They wrap to two rows only if the
	   column gets narrow enough that they'd otherwise collide. */
	.sign-off {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.25rem;
	}

	.resume {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--blue-dim);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 12%, transparent);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--text);
		transition:
			border-color 200ms ease-out,
			background-color 200ms ease-out;
	}

	.resume svg {
		width: 1.125rem;
		height: 1.125rem;
		transition: transform 200ms ease-out;
	}

	.resume:hover {
		border-color: var(--blue);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 22%, transparent);
	}

	.resume:hover svg {
		transform: translateY(2px);
	}

	/* Stays attached to the copy it timestamps — PLAN-about.md §2. */
	.written {
		margin-left: auto;
		text-align: right;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		opacity: 0.75;
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.resume,
		.resume svg {
			transition: none;
		}

		.resume:hover svg {
			transform: none;
		}
	}
</style>
